<p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_17b0c6fe-2fe9-ac6b-16ea-a155f04ab432" id="_17b0c6fe-2fe9-ac6b-16ea-a155f04ab432"></a><a href="https://schemas.isotc211.org/19115/-1/mcc/1.3.0/commonClasses.xsd">https://schemas.isotc211.org/19115/-1/mcc/1.3.0/commonClasses.xsd</a></p>
</td></tr></tbody></table></div>

