<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_c267c70c-f1ce-4536-d30e-115985872064" id="_c267c70c-f1ce-4536-d30e-115985872064"></a>The MD_ReferenceSystem is encoded as an XML object.</p>

<div align="center" class="table_container"><table class="MsoISOTable" style="mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;border-spacing:0;border-width:1px;" width="100%"><a name="_65ab8cf3-2ace-aece-d1bd-6d3e902bf481" id="_65ab8cf3-2ace-aece-d1bd-6d3e902bf481"></a><colgroup><col width="20%"/><col width="80%"/></colgroup><tbody><tr><td valign="middle" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:auto;" width="20.0%">Requirement 9</td><td valign="middle" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:auto;" width="80.0%"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_d7eb55da-ec19-e2b3-e60b-5a5e88c7f1e9" id="_d7eb55da-ec19-e2b3-e60b-5a5e88c7f1e9"></a>/req/base/isometadatatype/referencesystem</p>

