titude&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;/gex:EX_GeographicBoundingBox&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;/gex:geographicElement&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;/extent&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;mrs:MD_ReferenceSystem&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;mrs:referenceSystemIdentifier&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;mcc:MD_Identifier&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;mcc:code&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;gco:CharacterString&gt;</span>EPSG:4326<span class="nt">&lt;/gco:CharacterString&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;/mcc:code&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;/mcc:MD_Identifier&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;/mrs:referenceSystemIdentifier&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;/mrs:MD_ReferenceSystem&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;tasks&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;type&gt;</span>AI_EOTask<span class="nt">&lt;/type&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;id&gt;</span>whu_rs19-task<span class="nt">&lt;/id&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;description&gt;</span>Structural high-resolution satellite image indexing<span class="nt">&lt;/description&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;taskType&gt;</span>Scene Classification<span class="nt">&lt;/taskType&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;/tasks&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;data&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;type&gt;</span>AI_EOTrainingData<span class="nt">&lt;/type&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;id&gt;</span>airport_01<span class="nt">&lt;/id&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;dataSources&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;cit:title&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;gco:CharacterString&gt;</span>googleEarth<span class="nt">&lt;/gco:CharacterString&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;/cit:title&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;/dataSources&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;dataURL&gt;</span>image/Airport/airport_01.jpg<span class="nt">&lt;/dataURL&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;labels&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;type&gt;</span>AI_SceneLabel<span class="nt">&lt;/type&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;class&gt;</span>Airport<span class="nt">&lt;/class&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;/labels&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;/data&gt;</span></p>


<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_d4b05c47-cd58-0c84-70f6-0177d25aaec7" id="_d4b05c47-cd58-0c84-70f6-0177d25aaec7"></a>If the optional element AI_MetricsInLiterature is specified, this element is encoded as XML element with properties as shown in <a href="#table-ai-metricsinliterature-properties">Table 3</a>.</p>

<div align="center" class="table_container"><table class="MsoISOTable" style="mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;border-spacing:0;border-width:1px;" width="100%"><a name="_79fbf8bd-4d5d-0157-6b1e-f684dfbc5cad" id="_79fbf8bd-4d5d-0157-6b1e-f684dfbc5cad"></a><colgroup><col width="20%"/><col width="80%"/></colgroup><tbody><tr><td valign="middle" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:auto;" width="20.0%">Requirement 15</td><td valign="middle" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:auto;" width="80.0%"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_e727ee58-4a15-5927-1ec2-174e39b5e4f3" id="_e727ee58-4a15-5927-1ec2-174e39b5e4f3"></a>/req/aitrainingdataset/metricsinliterature</p>

<p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_4bdd90c6-4c35-9d0f-8ae2-c1165e4d7da8" id="_4bdd90c6-4c35-9d0f-8ae2-c1165e4d7da8"></a>Each AI_MetricsInLiterature value SHALL implement the Mandatory properties shown in <a href="#table-ai-metricsinliterature-properties">Table 3</a>.</p>
</td></tr></tbody></table></div>

