" width="25.0%">Metrics and results of AI/ML algorithms in the peer-reviewed literature.</td><td valign="middle" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:auto;" width="25.0%">NamedValue [1..*]</td><td valign="middle" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:auto;" width="25.0%">Mandatory</td></tr></tbody></table></div>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_79ab0269-e33d-f7f6-db0a-7427d001e5ca" id="_79ab0269-e33d-f7f6-db0a-7427d001e5ca"></a>Example:</p>

<p class="Sourcecode"><a name="_069a035c-bb7b-e9fa-0826-e1e0851a6105" id="_069a035c-bb7b-e9fa-0826-e1e0851a6105"></a>&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;doi&gt;</span>10.1109/TGRS.2019.2917161<span class="nt">&lt;/doi&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;algorithm&gt;</span>FACNN<span class="nt">&lt;/algorithm&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;metrics&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;key&gt;</span>Overall Accuracy<span class="nt">&lt;/key&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;value&gt;</span>0.9881<span class="nt">&lt;/value&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;/metrics&gt;</span></p>


