of the images used in the EO training dataset.</td><td valign="middle" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:auto;" width="25.0%">CharacterString [0..1]</td><td valign="middle" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:auto;" width="25.0%">Optional</td></tr></tbody></table></div>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_6a618537-bfd2-581d-74bc-8da6ae63eaf1" id="_6a618537-bfd2-581d-74bc-8da6ae63eaf1"></a>Example:</p>

<p class="Sourcecode"><a name="_b192e883-11d8-a913-cc39-b91090ed8124" id="_b192e883-11d8-a913-cc39-b91090ed8124"></a>&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;type&gt;</span>AI_EOTrainingDataset<span class="nt">&lt;/type&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;id&gt;</span>whu_rs19<span class="nt">&lt;/id&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;name&gt;</span>WHU-RS19<span class="nt">&lt;/name&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;description&gt;</span>Wuhan University-Remote Sensing 19 Categories (WHU-RS19) has 19 classes of remote sensing images scenes obtained from Google Earth<span class="nt">&lt;/description&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;license&gt;</span>CC BY-SA 4.0<span class="nt">&lt;/license&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;amountOfTrainingData&gt;</span>1013<span class="nt">&lt;/amountOfTrainingData&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;createdTime&gt;</span>2010-01-01T00:00:00<span class="nt">&lt;/createdTime&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;providers&gt;</span>Wuhan University<span class="nt">&lt;/providers&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;keywords&gt;</span>Remote Sensing<span class="nt">&lt;/keywords&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;keywords&gt;</span>Scene Classification<span class="nt">&lt;/keywords&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;numberOfClasses&gt;</span>19<span class="nt">&lt;/numberOfClasses&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;classes&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;key&gt;</span>Airport<span class="nt">&lt;/key&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;value&gt;</span>null<span class="nt">&lt;/value&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;/classes&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;classes&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0;&#xA0; <span class="nt">&lt;key&gt;</span>Beach<span class="nt">&lt;/key&gt;</span><br/>&#xA0;