        <div><a name="_0a98ade0-b012-bc80-ecaf-93943fb439f7" id="_0a98ade0-b012-bc80-ecaf-93943fb439f7"></a><h2>7.3.<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Requirements Class: AI_TrainingData</h2>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_31290cff-5f42-4737-4a61-bfbe15af790e" id="_31290cff-5f42-4737-4a61-bfbe15af790e"></a>The AI_TrainingData requirements class defines an XML encoding for the AI_TrainingData module, which is based on the UML model specified in the TrainingDML-AI Part 1: Conceptual Model Standard.</p>

