<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_7d7a7217-45a4-8847-c461-67e187140d89" id="_7d7a7217-45a4-8847-c461-67e187140d89"></a>The AI_TrainingData object is encoded as an XML element with properties shown in <a href="#table-ai-trainingdata-properties">Table 5</a>.</p>

