</td></tr></tbody></table></div>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_8448942d-ab2f-9760-c49d-8871a4b88573" id="_8448942d-ab2f-9760-c49d-8871a4b88573"></a>Examples:</p>

<p class="Sourcecode"><a name="_db958d7c-62c9-54de-7c05-2f1c92cb1f4b" id="_db958d7c-62c9-54de-7c05-2f1c92cb1f4b"></a> a)&#xA0;&#xA0; "manual"<br/>&#xA0;b)&#xA0;&#xA0; "semi-automatic"<br/>&#xA0;c)&#xA0;&#xA0; "automatic"<br/>&#xA0;d)&#xA0;&#xA0; "unknown"</p>

</div>
